        <type>sl_status_t</type>
        <definition>sl_status_t sl_bt_bluetooth_post</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>sl_bt_bluetooth_post</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Release the Bluetooth host stack command lock. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>See <ref refid="group__bluetooth__rtos__adaptation_1gaa7b9592f6f990160875fc32fe5028e6c" kindref="member">sl_bt_bluetooth_pend()</ref> for description of how an application needs to use the locking to guarantee thread-safety.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK the mutex has been released </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
